    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gordon Hughes Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this charming detached country cottage extending to approximately 112 sq.m. & set on circa 1 acre (being part of Folio No. LM19029) together with a range of traditional farm outbuildings.\r\n\r\nBuilt circa 1900, this property offers a rare opportunity to acquire a countryside home full of character and charm in a peaceful rural setting. The accommodation comprises a porch, living room, kitchen, dining room, bathroom and two bedrooms on the ground floor, together with two attic rooms on the first floor offering a variety of potential uses.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from Oil Fired Central Heating (OFCH), PVC double glazed windows, group water scheme and septic tank system. Externally, the property is complemented by a range of traditional farm buildings including a hay shed, cattle byre and barns, making it ideally suited to those seeking a rural lifestyle with additional storage or hobby farming potential.\r\n\r\nAn additional circa 11.4 acres of adjoining land is available by separate negotiation at a guide price of 54,000, offering further potential for agricultural, equestrian or hobby farming use.\r\n\r\nOffering excellent potential for further enhancement and personalisation, this property combines character, outbuildings and countryside living in a highly attractive rural setting.\r\n\r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment Only with Sole Selling Agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\nPorch\r\nLiving Room\r\nKitchen\r\nDining Room\r\nBathroom\r\n2 Bedrooms\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n2 Attic Rooms\r\n\r\nExternal Features:\r\nHay Shed\r\nCattle Byre\r\nTraditional Barns\r\nCirca 1 Acre Site\r\n\r\nOptional Additional Lands:\r\nCirca 12 Acres Available by Separate Negotiation"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming Detached Country Residence\r\nBuilt Circa 1900\r\nExtending to Approx. 112 sq.m.\r\nSet on Circa 1 Acre\r\nPart of Folio No. LM19029\r\nAdditional Circa 11.40 Acres Available for an additional 54,000\r\n2 Bedrooms & 2 Attic Rooms\r\nOil Fired Central Heating (OFCH)\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows\r\nHay Shed, Cattle Byre & Traditional Barns\r\nGroup Water Scheme\r\nExcellent Potential for Further Enhancement"
